198039015872/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 21, "playtime_forever": 2978, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2525, "last_played": 1666215398, "avatar": "74a4af309be17aa7c1138287a3d0c5301d10cddd"}, "language": "english", "review": "I played the game again after 10years and just gotta say: It is exactly as good as I remembered it. Playing as a Space Marine just feels SO damn good and powerful. The mix between ranged and melee fighting is just right and fits in perfectly with the lore.\nI remember there were mixed reviews at the time of release and I still hear people saying \"it's good, but not very good compared to other games of the genre\". And I say now the same as then: No other comparable game presents to you the dark future of the 41st millenium combined with VERY solid gameplay.\nAnd even the graphics aren't that bad 10years later due to great range of visibility and the huge scale of the levels. Also, the story - even though quite typical 40k stuff - isn't that bad and well presented with in-game cutscenes and dialogues.\nThe only real flaws are all minor, e.g. AI behaviour of some enemies getting stuck behind crates etc., but overall AI behaviour is still good.\n\nDefinitely a recommendation! \n10/10 = MUST PLAY for 40k fans\n8/10 for all others due to the age and some minor issues", "timestamp_created": 1662474947, "timestamp_updated": 1662474947, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.504132270812988281", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}]}